      "hizbQuarter": 85,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1408,
      "text": "Allah does not wrong people in the least, but it is people who wrong themselves.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 10,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُونُسَ",
        "englishName": "Yunus",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Jonas",
        "numberOfAyahs": 109,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 44,
      "juz": 11,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 214,
      "ruku": 176,
      "hizbQuarter": 85,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1409,
      "text": "On the Day when He will gather them, it will be as if they had not stayed [in this world] except for an hour of a day, they will recognize one another[40]. Those who denied the meeting of Allah will be losers, for they did not follow guidance.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 10,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُونُسَ",
        "englishName": "Yunus",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Jonas",
        "numberOfAyahs": 109,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 45,
      "juz": 11,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 214,
      "ruku": 176,
      "hizbQuarter": 85,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1410,
      "text": "Whether We show you [O Prophet] some of that [punishment] of which We warn them, or We cause you to die, to Us is their return, and Allah is a Witness to all what they do.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 10,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُونُسَ",
        "englishName": "Yunus",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Jonas",
        "numberOfAyahs": 109,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 46,
      "juz": 11,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 214,
      "ruku": 176,
      "hizbQuarter": 85,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1411,
      "text": "For every people there is a messenger. When their messenger comes, it will be judged[41] between them with justice, and they will not be wronged.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 10,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُونُسَ",
        "englishName": "Yunus",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Jonas",
        "numberOfAyahs": 109,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 47,
      "juz": 11,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 214,
      "ruku": 176,
      "hizbQuarter": 85,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1412,
      "text": "They say, “When will this warning[42] come to pass, if you are truthful?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 10,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُونُسَ",
        "englishName": "Yunus",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Jonas",
        "numberOfAyahs": 109,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 48,
      "juz": 11,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 214,
      "ruku": 176,
      "hizbQuarter": 85,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1413,
      "text": "Say, “I have no power to harm or benefit myself, except by the Will of Allah.” For every people there is an appointed term; when their time comes, they can neither delay it for a moment nor can they bring it forward.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 10,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُونُسَ",
        "englishName": "Yunus",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Jonas",
        "numberOfAyahs": 109,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 49,
      "juz": 11,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 214,
      "ruku": 176,
      "hizbQuarter": 85,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1414,
      "text": "Say, “What do you think, if His punishment were to overtake you by night or by day, what part of it would the wicked seek to hasten[43]?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 10,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُونُسَ",
        "englishName": "Yunus",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Jonas",
        "numberOfAyahs": 109,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 50,
      "juz": 11,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 214,
      "ruku": 176,
      "hizbQuarter": 85,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1415,
      "text": "Will you believe in it only after it befalls you[44]? Now! While you used to seek its hastening[45]?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 10,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُونُسَ",
        "englishName": "Yunus",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Jonas",
        "numberOfAyahs": 109,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 51,
      "juz": 11,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 214,
      "ruku": 176,
      "hizbQuarter": 85,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1416,
      "text": "Then the wrongdoers will be told, “Taste the everlasting punishment! Are you being recompensed except for what you used to earn?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 10,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُونُسَ",
        "englishName": "Yunus",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Jonas",
        "numberOfAyahs": 109,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 52,
      "juz": 11,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 214,
      "ruku": 176,
      "hizbQuarter": 85,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1417,
      "text": "They ask you, “Is it true?” Say, “Yes, by my Lord. It is certainly true, and you cannot escape it.”",
      "surah": {
